_en":"EGM held","ann":"11688663","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11688663","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-10-21","type":"egm","what":"特别股东大会","what_en":"EGM held","ann":"11679253","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11679253","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (10 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Oct (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"ES Sunlogy recently secured two subcontracts from Kerjaya Prospek totaling approximately RM25.07 million, and a purchase order for a battery energy storage system worth RM5.26 million. The company also made several material litigation announcements and swung to a loss in the latest quarter.","notable_en":["Wholly-owned subsidiary Savelite Engineering accepted two subcontracts from Kerjaya Prospek totaling RM25.07 million.","70%-owned subsidiary Sunlogy Asia Energy Storage accepted a purchase order from Kerjaya Property for a battery energy storage system worth RM5.26 million.","Shareholders approved a new shareholders' mandate for recurrent related party transactions at an EGM."],"risks_en":["The company made several material litigation announcements between September and October 2026.","The latest quarter recorded a net loss of RM5.64 million with revenue down 53.1% year-on-year."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 31 July 2026, revenue was RM35.44 million, down 38.9% QoQ and 53.1% YoY; net loss was RM5.64 million with a net margin of -15.9%, compared to a net margin of 4.1% in the previous quarter."}